      "title": "Uneven and combined development",
      "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5abec90a5542994516f45438_short/d6s0",
      "text": "Uneven and combined development (or unequal and combined development) is a Marxist concept to describe the overall dynamics of human history.",
