      "title": "Uneven and combined development",
      "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5abec90a5542994516f45438_short/d6s2",
      "text": "It was the basis of his political strategy of permanent revolution, which implied a rejection of the idea that a human society inevitably developed through a uni-linear sequence of necessary \"stages\".",
      "visible_time_s": 2.4839999999967404,
      "requested_subject": "",
      "resolved_title": "Uneven and combined development",
      "entity_resolution": "unspecified"
    },
    {
