      "text": "Trotsky's ideas matured under the influence of Georg Vollmar's study of a possibility of socialism in one country, as well as John Hobson, Rudolf Hilferding and Vladimir Lenin's studies of imperialism.",
      "visible_time_s": 2.4839999999967404,
      "requested_subject": "",
      "resolved_title": "Uneven and combined development",
      "entity_resolution": "unspecified"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "d6s4",
